{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04778","headline":"岳州西城 · 张说","name":"岳州西城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水国何辽旷，风波遂极天。\n西江三纪合，南浦二湖连。\n危堞临清境，烦忧暂豁然。\n九围观掌内，万象阅眸前。\n日去长沙渚，山横云梦田。\n汀葭变秋色，津树入寒烟。\n潜穴探灵诡，浮生揖圣仙。\n至今人不见，迹灭事空传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}